[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁーっ！\u3000千歳の淹れる茶はやはりうまい！\nケイウン一だな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahhhh! Chitose's tea is absolutely delicious! The best in all of Keiun!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほ、ほめすぎですよ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-you're being too kind..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に美味しいでござるよ！\n船旅の疲れに効くでござる～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It really is delicious! Just what I needed after that long sea voyage! Refreshing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こら、鬼門。ござるは古い口調だから\n禁止と言ったはずだが……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, Kimon. I told you to stop speaking like that, didn't I...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ！\u3000申し訳ございませぬ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah! My sincere apologies!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は、鬼門様らしくて、いいと思います……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think it suits you, Kimon..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうございます、千歳殿！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you, Chitose!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では早速だが、\nクロガネ島調査の結果を聞かせてくれるか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then, let's get right to it. What can you tell me about the results of the Kurogane Island survey?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。クロガネ島の鉱石採掘拠点は、人の不在により\n寂れてはいましたが、採掘は可能でした",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. The mining site on Kurogane Island had been abandoned and fallen into disrepair, but mining operations are still possible there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クロガネ島を占領していた魔物も討伐できましたので、\n環境を再度整えればすぐにでも採掘可能かと思いまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We also eliminated the demons that had taken over the island, so I believe we could resume mining immediately once the facilities are restored."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお！\u3000でかしたぞ、鬼門！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Excellent work, Kimon!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "して、鉱石は持ち帰ったか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And did you bring back any ore samples?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こちらがクロガネ島より持ち帰った鉱石にございまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here is the ore we brought back from Kurogane Island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どれ……ほう、これはいいものだ。\n早速鍛冶屋に渡して加工させよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let me see... Ah, this is excellent quality. I'll have the smiths begin working with it immediately."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "失礼ながら、鏑矢様。\nその鉱石はいったい何に使われるのですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Forgive me for asking, Lady Kaburaya, but what exactly will this ore be used for?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "武装だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Armaments."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "武装……ですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Armaments...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。余は今、コウセンと共に武装計画を進めている。\nこの鉱石は武器に加工しようと思ってな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. I'm currently working with Kosen on an armament project. I plan to have this ore forged into weapons."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "コウセン殿と……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With Lord Kosen..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "此度の任務の報酬は、永遠と合わせて\n後ほど与えよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll see that you and Towa receive your rewards for this mission later."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "興奮したらのどが渇いた！\n千歳！\u3000茶のおかわりをくれ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All this excitement has made me thirsty! Chitose! Another cup of tea, if you please."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（武装計画……鏑矢様のことだからきっと、\n\u3000何かお考えがあるに決まってるでござる）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(An armament project... Knowing Lady Kaburaya, she surely has some greater plan in mind.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（永遠なら何か知っているであろうか……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I wonder if Towa knows anything about this...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]